  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the food and nutrition security of 
Women, 700 children between 6 and 59 months and 800 caregivers through IYCF and nutrition support in Baalbek-Hermel and Bekaa in addition to 600 vulnerable Lebanese and 150 Syrian refugee households with food parcels and WASH kits in Baalbek-Hermel, Bekaa, South and Nabatiyeh.

Improving access to life-saving food assistance for 100 households -regardless of nationality -with suspected or confirmed covid-19 cases in the South governorate through the provision of one-off dry food baskets.</narrative>
  </title>
